He doesn't need a remote control signal!

45
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,100
Listen, Josuke.

46
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:56,928
If If you spot anything flying around
here, I want you to search for the user.

47
00:01:57,220 --> 00:02:01,044
Koichi's reverb has a range of 50
meters, so he can help out too.

48
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:06,217
If that stand gets to the ship before
we do, the old man is as good as dead.

49
00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:09,937
Your job is to stay on watch and
protect your father from the harbor.

50
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,160
We clear Josuke.

51
